Third-party benchmark material
==============================

This repository is an evaluation harness, not the upstream benchmark. The
curated lists in manifests/ contain task identifiers, categories, and excerpts
of upstream task instructions. Harness annotations and historical scores in
those lists are separate from the upstream task text. No VM images, task
fixtures, evaluator checkout, or binary packages are distributed here.

The source of the task metadata and instructions is MacPaw/MacArena at
commit dcdc7d366da12641578ab90f085d69db91651c58:
https://github.com/MacPaw/MacArena/tree/dcdc7d366da12641578ab90f085d69db91651c58

