  License: https://github.com/MacPaw/MacArena/blob/dcdc7d366da12641578ab90f085d69db91651c58/LICENSE
  Notice: https://github.com/MacPaw/MacArena/blob/dcdc7d366da12641578ab90f085d69db91651c58/NOTICE
